{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 542px;","style":"width: 532px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕤核 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕤核 4-20240811144215-nlsvwba.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 532px;\" parent-style=\"width: 542px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811150254-canuv7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811150254-canuv7y","updated":"20240811150254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 320px;","style":"width: 310px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕤核 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕤核 5-20240811144550-kao5cjm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 310px;\" parent-style=\"width: 320px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 322px;","style":"width: 312px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕤核 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕤核 6-20240811144636-81ok4s6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 312px;\" parent-style=\"width: 322px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 317px;","style":"width: 307px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕤核 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕤核 7-20240811144725-yehrrcv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 307px;\" parent-style=\"width: 317px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕤核 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕤核 10-20240811145345-dsq5ynb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240607151746-2vuhvbj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151746-2vuhvbj"}},{"ID":"20240614173303-lhr3nwa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-lhr3nwa","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-334ie5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-334ie5l","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-ziqspni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-ziqspni","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹邪气，明目，目赤痛伤泪出。久服轻身益气，不饥。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-emhbyqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-emhbyqi","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：蕤核，一名，神农雷公甘平无毒，生池泽，八月采，补中，强志，明目，久服不饥。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-aiui72h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-aiui72h","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生函谷，及巴西。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-j0zorx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-j0zorx5","updated":"20240614173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：桵，白桵，棫。《尔雅》云：棫，白桵.郭璞云：桵，小木。丛生有刺，实如耳珰，紫赤可啖。一切经音义云：本草作蕤，今桵核是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617111614-6m8od4b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617111614-6m8od4b"}},{"ID":"20240617111615-ibaoga5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617111615-ibaoga5","updated":"20240617111619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617111615-qoftvqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617111615-qoftvqc","updated":"20240617111615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温、微寒，无毒。主心腹邪结气，明目，目痛赤伤泪出。疗目肿 烂， 鼻，破心益气不饥。生函谷川谷及巴西。月采实。"}]},{"ID":"20240617111615-4ujmqah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617111615-4ujmqah","updated":"20240617111615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今从北方来，云出彭城间，形如乌豆大，圆而扁，有文理，状似胡桃桃核，今人皆合壳用为分两，此乃应破取仁秤之。医方唯以疗眼，《仙经》以合守中丸也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173303-78ex9mq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614173303-78ex9mq","updated":"20240614173303"}},{"ID":"20240607152241-6wjeli3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152241-6wjeli3","updated":"20240607152248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152241-gvbr95k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152241-gvbr95k","updated":"20240607152241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十二"}]},{"ID":"20240607152241-jwm0l0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152241-jwm0l0p","updated":"20240607152241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名 。神农、雷公∶甘，无毒，平，生池泽。八月采。补中强中，强志，明耳目，久服不饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-0qwnnt5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-0qwnnt5"}},{"ID":"20240607152227-olo3uya","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152227-olo3uya","updated":"20240607152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《濒湖炮炙法》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152227-rij6s24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152227-rij6s24","updated":"20240607152227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔曰〕凡使蕤核仁，以汤浸去皮、尖，擘作两片。每四两，用芒硝一两，木通草七两同水煮一伏时，取仁研膏入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152113-ihoxtua","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607152113-ihoxtua"}},{"ID":"20240607152212-17b0sn4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152212-17b0sn4","updated":"20240607152221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152212-qeia9lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152212-qeia9lx","updated":"20240607152212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得土气以生，味甘，温，微寒，无毒，入足厥阴经。厥阴为风木之脏，开窍于目，风热乘肝，则肝血虚而目为之病。此药温能散风，寒能除热，甘能补血，肝气和则目疾瘳也。用汤浸去皮，尖劈作两片，用芒硝木通通草同煎，一伏时取出研膏入。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152212-49c4zpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152212-49c4zpy","updated":"20240607152212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核，专治眼科，消上下泡，风肿烂弦，除左右 热障 肉，退火止泪，益水生光。退翳膜之赤筋，及赤肿 烂，并主心腹邪结气，及结痰痞气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-s8pay8c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-s8pay8c"}},{"ID":"20240607152159-s8odd0t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152159-s8odd0t","updated":"20240607152208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152159-s0i687j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152159-s0i687j","updated":"20240607152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（灌木）散肝风热"}]},{"ID":"20240607152159-fj851el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152159-fj851el","updated":"20240607152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核（专入肝。）眼科药也。凡眼多因风热乘肝。以致血虚而目不得明。故病必见上下眼胞风肿弦烂。左右 热障 。（仁斋曰。拘急牵飕。瞳青胞白。痒而清泪。不赤不痛。是为风眼。乌轮突起。胞硬红肿。眵泪湿浆。里热刺痛。是为热眼。眼浑而泪。胞肿而软。上壅。酸涩微赤。是为气眼。风与热并。则痒而浮赤。风与气搏。则痒涩皆沉。血热交聚。故生淫肤粟肉红缕偷针之类。气血不至。故有眇视胞垂雀眼盲障之形。淡紫而隐红者为虚热。鲜红而妒赤者为实热。两 呈露生 肉者。此心热血旺。白睛红膜如伞纸者。此气滞血凝。热滞则瞳人内涌。白睛带赤。冷症则瞳仁青绿。白睛枯槁。眼热经久。复为风热所乘。则赤烂。眼中不赤。但为痰饮则作疼。肝气不顺而挟热。所以羞明。热气蓄聚而伤饱。所以胞合。白睛带赤或红筋者。其热在肺。上胞下胞或目唇间如疮点者。其热属脾。翳起肺家受热。翳如碎米状者易散。翳如梅花者难消。）得此温能散风。（气不甚温。）寒能胜热。甘能补血。俾火退泪止。而目疾瘳矣。赤筋在翳膜外者。得此则宜。（拨云膏取下翳膜。蕤仁去油五分。青盐一分。猪 子五钱。共捣二千下如泥。 收点之。又方。蕤仁二两。去油。入白蓬砂一钱。麝香二分。研匀收。去翳妙不可言。）汤浸。去皮尖。劈作两片。芒硝木通通草同煎一伏时。取出研膏入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152143-bdkm53h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607152143-bdkm53h"}},{"ID":"20240607152145-i8jyhof","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152145-i8jyhof","updated":"20240607152151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152145-holkp4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152145-holkp4x","updated":"20240607152145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温、微寒，无毒。主心腹邪结气，明目，目赤痛伤泪出、目肿 烂、 鼻，破心下结痰痞气，久服轻身益气。《药性论》云∶蕤仁，使。能治鼻衄。古方∶惟治眼。《传信方》∶治眼风泪痒，或生翳或赤 ，一切皆主之。生∶函谷川谷，今河东亦有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152121-4vy88po","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607152121-4vy88po"}},{"ID":"20240607152128-sw0kkd8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152128-sw0kkd8","updated":"20240607152133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152128-il8a48q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152128-il8a48q","updated":"20240607152128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温，微寒，无毒。主心腹邪结气，明目，目赤痛，伤泪出。目肿 烂， 鼻，破心下结痰，痞气。久服轻身，益气不饥，生函谷川谷及巴西。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-50u4xk8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-50u4xk8"}},{"ID":"20240607152059-fvydkwo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-fvydkwo","updated":"20240607152105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152059-rsv1hyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-rsv1hyz","updated":"20240607152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」白。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152059-8jjk2pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-8jjk2pu","updated":"20240607152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152059-e7q098i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-e7q098i","updated":"20240607152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240607152059-uavkq97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-uavkq97","updated":"20240607152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、多种眼疾（眼目昏暗，痒痛隐涩，赤肿羞明，能远视，迎风有泪，多见黑花）。用蕤仁（去皮，压去油）二两、脑子二钱半，一起研匀，加生蜜六钱，收存点眼。此方名“零星雪膏”。又方：用蕤仁（去油）三钱，甘、草、防风各六钱，黄连五钱，先以的在味煎取浓汁，次下蕤仁作成膏，每日点眼。眼方名“百点膏”。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152059-639zh3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152059-639zh3j","updated":"20240607152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、目翳。用蕤仁（去油）五分、盐一分、猪胰子五钱，共捣如泥，收存点眼，能取下翳膜。又方：用蕤仁（去油）一两，加白蓬砂一钱、麝香二分，研匀收存，去翳甚效。这两个方子，都称为“拔云膏”。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-6mth9bi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-6mth9bi"}},{"ID":"20240607152041-t23njtm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152041-t23njtm","updated":"20240607152047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152041-x16hoe5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152041-x16hoe5","updated":"20240607152052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核，生函谷川谷及巴西，今河东亦有之。其木高五、七尺，茎间有刺；叶细似枸杞而尖长；花白，子红紫色，附枝茎而生，类五味子，六月成熟。五月、六月采实；去核壳，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152041-q1c1572","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152041-q1c1572","updated":"20240607152041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古今方惟用治眼。刘禹锡《传信方》所着法最奇，云∶眼风泪痒，或生翳，或赤 ，一切皆主之。宣州黄连捣筛末；蕤核仁去皮，碾为膏；缘此性稍湿，末不得故耳，与黄连等分和合；取无 病干枣三枚，割头少许留之，去却核，以二物满填于中，却取所割下枣头依前合定，以少绵裹之，惟薄绵为佳，以大茶碗量水半碗于银器中，文武火煎取一鸡子以来，以绵滤，待冷，点眼万万不失。前后试验数十人皆应。今医家亦多用得效，故附也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-65k8j8v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-65k8j8v"}},{"ID":"20240607151855-r4hd9z0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-r4hd9z0","updated":"20240607151906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-tfh1lhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-tfh1lhf","updated":"20240607151855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温、微寒，无毒。主心腹邪结气，明目，目赤，痛伤泪出，目肿 烂， 鼻，心下结痰痞气。久服轻身益气，不饥。生函谷川谷及巴西。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-pknq33e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-pknq33e","updated":"20240607151855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今从北方来，云出彭城间。形如乌豆大，圆而扁，有纹理，状似胡桃桃核。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-2p0d1a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-2p0d1a4","updated":"20240607151855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人皆合壳用为分两，此乃应破取仁秤之。医方唯以疗眼。《仙经》以合守中丸也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶树生，叶细似枸杞而狭长。花白，子附茎生，紫赤色，大如五味子。茎多细刺。六月熟。今出雍州。五月、六月采，晒干。药性论云∶蕤仁，使。一名曰堪。能治鼻衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-htd5x5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-htd5x5m","updated":"20240607151855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶蕤核，生函谷川谷及巴西，今河东亦有之。其木高五、七尺，茎间有刺。叶细似枸杞而尖长，花白，子红紫色，附枝茎而生，类五味子。六月成熟，五月、六月采实，去核壳阴干。古今方唯用治眼。刘禹锡《传信方》所着法最奇。云∶眼风泪痒，或生翳，或赤，一切皆主之。宣州黄连捣筛末，蕤核仁去皮碾为膏，缘此性稍湿，末不得故耳。与黄连等分和合，取无 病干枣三枚，割头少许留之去却核，以二物满填于中，却取所割下枣头，根据前合定，以少绵裹之，唯薄绵为佳。以大茶碗量水半碗，于银器中，文武火煎取一鸡子以来，以绵滤，待冷点眼，万万不失。前后试验数十人皆应，今医家亦多用得效，故附也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151855-m7kwwag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151855-m7kwwag","updated":"20240607151855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，先汤浸去皮、尖，擘作两片。用芒硝、木通草二味，和蕤仁同水煮一伏时后沥出，去诸般药取蕤仁，研成膏，任加减入药中使。每修事四两，用芒硝一两，木通草七两。陈藏器蕤子，生熟足睡不眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-dtg09da","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-dtg09da"}},{"ID":"20240607151757-u11mhye","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607151757-u11mhye","updated":"20240607151801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240607151757-e8dxiwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151757-e8dxiwo","updated":"20240607151757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仁味甘，微寒。无毒。主心腹邪结气及心下结痰痞气。益气明目，治目肿 烂风痒、赤痛泪出、鼻鼻衄。凡使，去壳取仁，汤泡去皮尖。每四两用芒硝一两，木通七两，同煮一伏时，取仁研膏，任加减入药，极治风热。如风虚者，去皮尖，后用纸压去油净，以花椒煎浓汁调成膏，涂瓷碗底上，用蕲艾烧烟熏七次，然后取碗于火上， 之若油起，即以竹纸拭去，直待油尽色黑，即取碗覆地上，以去火毒，随宜入片脑等，点眼甚效，治眼风或生翳，或 赤，一切眼疾并主之。蕤仁研膏，入黄连末等分和匀，取干枣三枚，割头少许，去核，以前末填满，以枣头合定，用薄绵裹之，以水半碗，于银器中文武火煎，取鸡子壳以来，以绵滤过，待冷点眼，神效神效！。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151747-r4d3qaz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151747-r4d3qaz"}},{"ID":"20240607151748-twjftdh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-twjftdh","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤核"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-aeuk2zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-aeuk2zi","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-5bx3h6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-5bx3h6o","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ruí Hé"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-qzh42uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-qzh42uv","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-m9pnbs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-m9pnbs1","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蕤仁、马茄子"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-w5az15k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-w5az15k","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-5qiu5dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-5qiu5dl","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蔷薇科扁核木属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"扁核木"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Prinsepia uniflora Batal.，以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"核仁"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。秋季果实成熟后采收，去果肉，晒干，用时打碎果壳，取种仁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-hixhppb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-hixhppb","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-n4jmvwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-n4jmvwb","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-gbopymy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-gbopymy","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-ovuxy5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-ovuxy5t","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清肝明目。用于眼结膜炎，睑缘炎，角膜云翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-nx0c2ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-nx0c2ed","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-9hjlqo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-9hjlqo0","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱，水煎服或煎汤洗眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-51aitkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-51aitkz","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607151748-p8fr1t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607151748-p8fr1t8","updated":"20240607151748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240607151749-x6lpny2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607151749-x6lpny2"}},{"ID":"20240607152259-tra8zdx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-tra8zdx","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蕤仁"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-81esvgn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-81esvgn","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：蕤仁"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-gx0os8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-gx0os8m","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-4nsqf8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-4nsqf8r","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ruí Rén"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-wvq1rl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-wvq1rl3","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-0xkeol0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-0xkeol0","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" NUX PRINSEPIAE"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-zzm8xff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-zzm8xff","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-mp89i15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-mp89i15","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蔷薇科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蕤核"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Prinsepia uniflora Batal . 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"齿叶扁核木"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Prinsepia uniflora Batal. var. serrata Rehd.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟果核"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋间采摘成熟果实，除去果肉，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-tiyh9tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-tiyh9tf","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-owy55ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-owy55ub","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈类卵圆形，稍扁，长7～10mm,宽6～8mm，厚3～5mm。表面淡黄棕色或深棕色，有明显的网状沟纹，间有棕褐色果肉残留，顶端尖，两侧略不对称。质坚硬。种子扁平卵圆形，种皮薄，浅棕色或红棕色，易剥落；子叶2，乳白色,有油脂。无臭，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-2agnr1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-2agnr1v","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-d6p3oi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-d6p3oi2","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-0gizcfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-0gizcfy","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-4brqx39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-4brqx39","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，洗净，晒干。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-2tagu1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-2tagu1p","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ng16jtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ng16jtn","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-tvbc2mw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-tvbc2mw","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-9mb9cja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-9mb9cja","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-we237h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-we237h4","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-voxfrns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-voxfrns","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养肝明目，疏风散热。用于目赤肿痛，睑弦赤烂，目暗羞明。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ssen254","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ssen254","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-anv8vzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-anv8vzm","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-0cx53t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-0cx53t4","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-0nsnz28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-0nsnz28","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-9gzprvz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-9gzprvz","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蕤仁"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-fyy7mb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-fyy7mb5","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-e7b583h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-e7b583h","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ruí Rén"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ttvukx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ttvukx0","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-r1r7ft2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-r1r7ft2","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蕤核（《本经》），蕤子（《本草拾遗》），白桵仁、棫仁、美仁子（《药材资料汇编》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-m8cxtuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-m8cxtuy","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-tl067me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-tl067me","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-dbmlu7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-dbmlu7j","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ewnqgod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ewnqgod","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蔷薇科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"单花扁核木"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟果核"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋果实成熟时采摘，除去果肉，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-y8g365s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-y8g365s","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ocaetap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ocaetap","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于山坡或川河间沙丘上。分布山西、陕西、甘肃、内蒙古、河南。主产山西、陕西、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-8wv4x14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-8wv4x14","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-26i9qyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-26i9qyw","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单花扁核木，又名：棫、白桵（《尔雅》），桵（《说文》），椹（《药性论》），蕤李子（《救荒本草》），山桃、小马茹子、马茹。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-b7affw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-b7affw4","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"落叶灌木，高达1.5米。茎多分枝，外皮棕褐色；叶腋有短刺。单叶互生或丛生；柄长1～5毫米；叶片线状长圆形，狭倒卵形或卵状披针形，长3～6厘米，宽5～10毫米，先端钝，有小突尖或微凹，基部楔形，两侧下延成叶柄，全缘或具疏锯齿。花1～3朵簇生叶腋，直径约1.5厘米，花梗长5～10毫米；萼筒杯状，裂片5，阔而短，绿色：花瓣5，近圆形，有爪，白色；雄蕊10，花药卵圆形，花丝短；雌蕊子房卵圆形，花柱插生于近基部处，柱头头状。核果球形，直径1～1.5厘米，熟时黑色，表面微被蜡质白粉。花期4～6月。果期7～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-wws40fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-wws40fe","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-l36q5ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-l36q5ee","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥果核呈稍扁的类心脏形，两侧略不对称。表面浅棕色至暗棕色，有深色的网状沟纹。质坚硬。敲开硬壳，内含扁平类圆形或心脏形的种子，种皮棕色至暗棕色，子叶2片，白色肥厚，富油性。气无，味微苦。以浅棕色、饱满肥实者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-4hvvduk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-4hvvduk","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-rae9npx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-rae9npx","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种子含水分10.36％，灰分1.72％，蛋白质3.53％，脂肪7.57％，纤维56.91％。种仁含油脂36％。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-n8knh7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-n8knh7t","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-yg5m9ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-yg5m9ir","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣去杂质，洗净，晒干，用时捣碎，或敲去内果皮取种仁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-iv1csmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-iv1csmg","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-71xb7it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-71xb7it","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-tkhv9er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-tkhv9er","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入心、肝、脾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-jobkhmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-jobkhmd","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《玉楸药解》：\"入手太阴肺、足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-nx4nn1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-nx4nn1e","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ge6obn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ge6obn6","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-lk8bs52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-lk8bs52","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-jkqe7hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-jkqe7hi","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医林纂要》：\"甘咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-vgkhr8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-vgkhr8i","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-jk864ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-jk864ce","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"目病非关风热，而因于肝肾两虚者，不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-vprtf59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-vprtf59","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-6gi8pq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-6gi8pq3","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风，散热，养肝，明目。治目赤肿痛，昏暗羞明，眦烂多泪，鼻衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-stwdif2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-stwdif2","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主心腹邪结气，明目，目赤痛伤泪出。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-hmmigtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-hmmigtg","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"补中强志，明耳目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-rdwh920","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-rdwh920","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"目肿眦烂，齆鼻，破心下结痰痞气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-lx2r5ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-lx2r5ji","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"治鼻衄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-s5rx5g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-s5rx5g6","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草拾遗》：\"生治足睡，熟治不眠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-81rgb84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-81rgb84","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草蒙筌》：\"专治眼科，消上下胞风肿烂弦，除左右眦热障胬肉，退火止泪，益水生光。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-q7fd8z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-q7fd8z5","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-a7b83z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-a7b83z8","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱。外用：去油研成膏点眼或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-szsuxce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-szsuxce","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-x02n5jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-x02n5jz","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治肝经不足，内受风热，上攻眼目，昏暗痒痛，隐涩难开，昏眩赤肿，怕日羞明，不能远视，迎风有泪，多见黑花：脑子（研）二钱半，蕤仁（去皮壳，压去油）二两。上用生蜜六钱，将脑子、蕤仁同搜和，每用少许点之。（《局方》春雪膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-i4kwiw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-i4kwiw0","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治眼病翳遮瞳人，视物不明，有云气之状：蕤仁（去皮、尖）三分，当归身、甘草各六分，防风八分，黄连（拣治）二钱（锉如麻豆大，水一大碗，煎至一半入药）。上件锉如麻豆大，蕤仁别研如泥，同熬，滴在水中不敌，入去沫蜜少许，再熬少时为度，令病人心静点之，至目中微痛，日用五、七次，临卧点尤疾效，但欲多点，使药力相继也。（《兰室秘藏》百点膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-z9c2kv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-z9c2kv6","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③取下翳膜：㈠蕤仁（去油）五分，青盐一分，猪胰子五钱。共捣二千下，如泥，罐收，点之。（《纲目》拨云膏）㈡蕤仁一两（去油），入白蓬砂一钱，麝香二分，研匀，收点之。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-oz4hl0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-oz4hl0t","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治赤烂眼：㈠蕤仁（去皮）四十九个，胡粉（煅如金色）一鸡子大，研匀，入酥一杏仁许，龙脑三豆许，研匀，油纸裹收，每以麻子许，涂大小眦上，频用取效。（《近效方》）㈡蕤仁、杏仁各一两，去皮研匀，入腻粉少许为丸，每用热汤化洗。（《经验良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ntrxip9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ntrxip9","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-nl672u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-nl672u6","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《医林纂要》：\"白蕤仁，功略同酸枣仁，生则咸多，布散神明之用；熟则甘多，安定神明之主。人知其治目疾，而不知其能补心久矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-zmxnd20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-zmxnd20","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-bo9t56m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-bo9t56m","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-9o67usn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-9o67usn","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蕤仁"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-armp52u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-armp52u","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-f7ed266","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-f7ed266","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ruí Rén"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-mhuxur2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-mhuxur2","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-efo3gvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-efo3gvy","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蕤核、蕤子、白挼仁、棫仁、美仁子、单花扁核木、蕤李子、山桃、小马茹子、蕤核仁"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-s4qqn4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-s4qqn4t","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-rfvgsn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-rfvgsn9","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hedge Prinsepia Nut"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-6yx070m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-6yx070m","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-qypgvb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-qypgvb5","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.陶弘景：蕤核，今从北方来，云出彭城间。形如乌豆，大圆而扁，有文理，状似胡桃，今人皆合壳用为分两，此乃应破取仁秤之，医方惟以疗眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-86zefbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-86zefbl","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：《图经》云，蕤核树生叶细似构杞而狭长，花白，干附茎生，紫赤色，大如五味子，茎多细刺，六月熟。今出雍州。五月、六月采，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-wv5em7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-wv5em7t","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-op74ez1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-op74ez1","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蔷薇科植物单花扁核木的核仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-u0y7vob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-u0y7vob","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Prinsepia uniflora Batal."}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-dx60cmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-dx60cmb","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋间果实成熟时采摘，除去果肉，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ovarr06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ovarr06","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-kwsbpa9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-kwsbpa9","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔900-1100m的山坡、河谷等处的稀疏灌丛中或干旱沙丘上。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-szqp5gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-szqp5gf","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于山西、内蒙古、陕西、甘肃、河南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-2hctpj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-2hctpj4","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ro29kel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ro29kel","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单花扁核木 灌木，高达1-2m。茎多分枝，树皮红褐色或棕褐色，幼枝灰绿色或灰褐色，具较细短刺或叶腋有短刺。单叶互生，在短枝上呈簇生状，具短柄；叶片狭长椭圆形至条状披针形，长2-5.5cm，宽6-8mm，先端钝，基部楔形，边缘有细锯齿或近基部全缘。花两性；单生或3朵簇生；萼筒杯状，5裂；花瓣5，白色；雄蕊10，2轮，花丝很短，花药黄色；子房上位，花柱侧生，柱头头状。核果球形，熟时紫黑色，直径8-12mm，被蜡质白粉，萼片宿存；核扁卵形，有网状花纹。花期4-5月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-t4nha14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-t4nha14","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ooufkhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ooufkhp","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 果核呈扁心脏形或扁卵形，两侧略不对称，长7-10mm，宽6-8mm厚3-5mm。表面浅棕色至暗棕色，有深色的网状沟纹，常有棕褐色果肉残留。质坚硬，敲开果核后，可见种子为扁平的类圆形或心脏形，长6-7mm，宽约5mm，厚约2mm，种皮红棕色，膜质，两面有深色纵脉纹3-5条，尖端侧有淡色短种脐，圆端有合点，两者之间有深色种脊；子叶白色肥厚，油质，气无，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-4f6fl9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-4f6fl9b","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以浅棕色、颗粒饱满肥厚、表面纹理清楚者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-w0cxouo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-w0cxouo","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 内果皮横切面：由多层排列紧密的石细胞组成，石细胞多为长圆形，长条形，少数类圆形，直径14-130μm，壁极厚，孔沟明显，中部常成环状断裂，偶有胞腔内含黄棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-myiiy1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-myiiy1x","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"种皮横切面：种皮外表皮为3-4列棕色细胞，有时可见壁孔，其下为数列颓废的薄壁细胞，种皮的内表皮为1列无色大型薄壁细胞，外胚乳颓废，内胚乳1列，含油滴。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-e7eoa5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-e7eoa5d","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-07wzypp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-07wzypp","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种子含水分10.36%，灰分1.72%，蛋白质3.53%，脂肪7.57%，纤维56.91%。种仁含油脂36%。幼枝含氰(cyanogen)。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-gvtjaq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-gvtjaq7","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-5iv9b1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-5iv9b1o","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣去杂质，洗净，晒干，用时捣碎，或敲去内果皮取种仁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-rezl3cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-rezl3cc","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-hj0shj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-hj0shj9","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）取粉末0.5g，置带塞试管中，加5%硫酸溶液3ml，充分混合，试管口放一用三硝基苯酚钠溶液湿润的滤纸条，塞紧，将试管置40-50℃水浴中加热10min，滤纸条由黄色变砖红色。（检查氰甙类）（2）薄层色谱 取样品0.5g，加等量碳酸钙(CaCO/3)共研碎，放入具塞三角瓶内，加石油醚（60-90℃）4ml浸泡过夜后，吸去石油醚，吹干，再加入乙醇4ml冷浸过夜，用乙醇浸液点样，以苦杏仁甙作对照，吸取上述二溶液分别点样于硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿-乙酸乙酯-乙醇（2：1：2）为展开剂展开，取出，晾干，以碘蒸气熏后，供试液色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置，显相同的黄色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-t11n0br","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-t11n0br","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-e0kwl5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-e0kwl5k","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；心；脾；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ryy4tiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ryy4tiu","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-3vuf2do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-3vuf2do","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-8cwcvh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-8cwcvh7","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-98tnbvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-98tnbvr","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风散热；养肝明目；安神。主目赤肿痛；昏暗羞明；眦烂多泪；夜寐不安"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-bhf7wlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-bhf7wlz","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-xz2wbi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-xz2wbi7","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-10g。外用：适量，去油研膏点眼；或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-g36fvsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-g36fvsb","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-x1yo5c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-x1yo5c0","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治肝经不足，内受风热，上攻眼目，昏暗痒痛，隐涩难开，昏眩赤肿，怕日羞明，不能远视，迎风有泪，多见黑花：脑子(研)二钱半，蕤仁(去皮壳，压去油)二两。上用生蜜六钱，将脑子、蕤仁同搜和，每用少许点之。(《局方》春雪膏)②治眼病翳遮瞳人，视物不明，有云气之状：蕤仁(去皮、尖)三分，当归身、甘草各六分，防风八分，黄连(拣治)二钱(锉如麻豆大，水一大碗，煎至一半人药)。上件锉如麻豆大，蕤仁别研如泥，同熬，滴在水中不散，入去沫蜜少许，再熬少时为度，令病人心静点之，至目中微痛，日用五、七次，临卧点尤疾效，但欲多点，使药力相继也。(《兰室秘藏》百点膏)③取下翳膜：一蕤仁(去油)五分，青盐一分，猪胰子五钱。共捣二千下，如泥，罐收，点之。(《纲目》拨云膏)二蕤仁一两(去油)，入白蓬砂一钱，麝香二分，研匀，收点之。(《纲目》)④治赤烂眼：一蕤仁(去皮)四十九个，胡粉(煅如金色)一鸡子大，研匀，入酥一杏仁许，龙脑三豆许，研匀，油纸裹收，每以麻子许，涂大小眦上，频用取效。(《近效方》)二蕤仁、杏仁各一两，去皮研匀，入腻粉少许为丸，每用热汤化洗。(《经验良方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-rn1id1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-rn1id1t","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-175hs4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-175hs4d","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《医林纂要》：白蕤仁，功略同酸枣仁，生则咸多，布散神明之用；熟则甘多，安定神明之主。入知其治目疾，而不知其能补心久矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-4u0x341","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-4u0x341","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主心腹邪结气，明目，目赤痛伤泪出。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-xioo4ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-xioo4ea","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《吴普本草》：补中强志，明耳目。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-iho38na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-iho38na","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：目肿眦烂，破心下给痰痞气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-37wdirv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-37wdirv","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：治鼻衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ku4er4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ku4er4l","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草拾遗》：生治足睡，熟治不眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-csmrtpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-csmrtpn","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草蒙筌》：专治眼科，消上下胞风肿烂弦，除左右眦热障胬肉，退火止泪，益水生光。"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-oazeaao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-oazeaao","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607152259-ipslhgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152259-ipslhgp","updated":"20240607152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607152301-zrt7tbw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607152301-zrt7tbw"}},{"ID":"20240607152302-tw9gng0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607152302-tw9gng0"}}]}